{"vid":"z_4U3QUMldA","source":"z_4U3QUMldA.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Hello everyone. I'm Joshua Burgess, your AWS president, and I'm very excited to invite"},{"t":5,"txt":"all of our young professionals and students to an upcoming event on September the 9th at 6 p.m. So,"},{"t":11.5,"txt":"Danea Buschkoetter and myself will be hosting a virtual fireside chat,"},{"t":16.1,"txt":"and it's designed specifically for students and young professionals who"},{"t":19.4,"txt":"are navigating their future into the welding industry. So during this 1-hour conversation,"},{"t":23.8,"txt":"we'll talk about resources and opportunities and career development and all the many ways"},{"t":29,"txt":"AWS can help support you as you enter or grow within the industry. It'll be an open informal"},{"t":34.7,"txt":"dialogue where you can ask questions directly and you can engage with us in real time. You'll"},{"t":40.7,"txt":"also have an opportunity to submit some questions ahead of the event and we'll review those along"},{"t":45.4,"txt":"with all the questions you shared on social media to make sure we cover what matters to you most."},{"t":50.6,"txt":"I encourage you all to attend. Please bring your curiosity, bring your questions and"},{"t":55.3,"txt":"join us for an engaging conversation. I look forward to connecting with you."}],"words":[{"t":0.003,"w":"Hello"},{"t":0.003,"w":"everyone."},{"t":0.003,"w":"I'm"},{"t":0.003,"w":"Joshua"},{"t":0.003,"w":"Burgess,"},{"t":0.003,"w":"your"},{"t":0.003,"w":"AWS"},{"t":0.003,"w":"president,"},{"t":0.003,"w":"and"},{"t":0.003,"w":"I'm"},{"t":0.003,"w":"very"},{"t":0.003,"w":"excited"},{"t":0.003,"w":"to"},{"t":0.003,"w":"invite"},{"t":4.963,"w":"all"},{"t":4.963,"w":"of"},{"t":4.963,"w":"our"},{"t":4.963,"w":"young"},{"t":4.963,"w":"professionals"},{"t":4.963,"w":"and"},{"t":4.963,"w":"students"},{"t":4.963,"w":"to"},{"t":4.963,"w":"an"},{"t":4.963,"w":"upcoming"},{"t":4.963,"w":"event"},{"t":4.963,"w":"on"},{"t":4.963,"w":"Se